window.products.push({"id":1139093,"name":"Silicone Baking Mat Extra Large with Measurements & Conversions,Bonus Silicone Baking Brush & Spatula,Non Stick Non Skid Pastry Mat 23\" x 15.1\" By Fun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qLZ4yzEGL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Why choose the Funwhale Silicone Baking Mat? Measuring 21 inches x 12 inches, the Funwhale is outlined with inch and centimeter ruled guides, displays 2 inch and 3 inch cookie circles, and includes 5 to10-inch diameter guides perfect for rolling out pie crust, pizza dough, pasta, or fondant.  Heat Resistant baking mat can be used in the microwave or oven as a liner for your cookware.  Made of BPA free, high-quality food grade silicone, the Funwhale requires no parchment paper, cooking sprays, or oils and is effective from temperatures of -45°F (-43°C) to 450°F (230°C). Non-stick surface lets you skip greasing!  Design includes weight, temperature & metric conversions Printed sizing guide lets you make perfectly proportioned cookies and pie crusts.  Unlike other silicone mats for baking, it has a fine mesh fiberglass core to prevent wear and tear.  Washes easily with warm water and soap. Can also be placed in the dishwasher. Package included: 1 x Silicone Baking Mat, 23\" x 15.1\", With Measurements & Conversions   1 x Spatula   1 x Silicone Brush What are you waiting for?! When you click in the ADD TO CART button at the top right of this page you'll get the best Silicone Pastry Mat you'll EVER OWN!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qLZ4yzEGL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunWhale","source_asin":"B01L3A027G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L3A027G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L3A027G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139094,"name":"FUSIONKEI 7.5 Inch Japanese Chef Knife Hand Forged Boning Knife Kiritsuke Knife Full Tang Meat Vegetable Cleaver High Carbon Steel Kitchen Knife With ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sKH63XcVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KITCHEN WORKHORSE - A high-quality kitchen knife is the foundation for preparing a wonderful meal. This 7.5\" chef's knife is just what you need in the kitchen, with which everything from fruits and vegetables to fish and meat can be perfectly chopped, diced, minced and sliced. This knife is perfect to do most daily tasks in the kitchen, not just for professional chefs, but also for cooking amateurs. PREMIUM QUALITY - This kiritsuke knife is heat-treated and finely hand-forged, resulting in a blade with unique texture and perfect hardness of 60±2. Made from high-quality carbon steel, the 7.5 inch chef knife is both corrosion and wear resistant. Keeping the knife clean and dry after each use and oil it regularly will help it last longer. RAZOR SHARP EDGE - Our boning knife comes with a sharp V-edge, finely ground to 15 degrees on each side, which allows for long-lasting sharpness and easy honing of the knife. The flat-ground edge also provides a smooth, clean, precise cut and can work with a variety of meats, vegetables and fruits. Even if the blade gets dull, it will regain its sharpness with a simple sharpening. CONSIDERATE DESIGN - The full-tang blade and triple-riveted handle ensure ideal balance and weight, making the chef knife effortless to use. The finger hole provides a comfortable thumb support for better control and safety, which also keeps the knife from easily slipping out of the hand. The black hammered texture on the blade gives the boning knife a nice look as well as anti-stick properties as it increases the friction between the knife and food. RISK-FREE - All of our chef knives pass strict quality control before shipped and will definitely meet your expectations. We offer a considerate customer service, including a return and exchange policy. Everything is for ensuring your pleasant and risk-free purchase! With the nice packaging and premium quality, this kiritsuke knife is not only a collection but also a surprise gift for your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sKH63XcVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUSIONKEI","source_asin":"B0BYR8GG3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYR8GG3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYR8GG3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
