window.products.push({"id":1139141,"name":"WJPILIS 4 Cavities Silicone Butter Mold Tray,with Rectangular Lid and Butter Container,Suitable for Butter Sticks, Chocolate Cookies, Cake Decoration,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NGFahtGQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🍭【Butter Mold With Lid】 Includes a 4-cavity silicone butter mold and a butter dish. The size of each mold is 7 X 5 X 2.2 inches, and the size of each cavity is 1 inch wide and 1.7 inches deep. The safe temperature range is -40°F to +446°F (-40°C to +230°C), microwave, oven, refrigerator, and freezer are safe. It is a good choice for storing butter. 🍭【Food Grade Material】The four-cavity silicone butter mold is made of soft and durable silicone, which is different from the traditional fragile and fragile plastic abrasive, and it is durable. It does not contain BPA food-grade safe materials, nor does it contain additives. It can be used safely by children and the elderly, soft, thick and easy to peel off. 🍭【Easy to Clean】Pour favorite items into the grinding tool. After cooling, turn it upside down, and then gently push it in from the bottom to release the baked food from the mold without cracking and deforming. You can easily take out the butter soap pudding. The silicone material is easy to clean without sticking to your hands and is dishwasher safe. 🍭【Silicone Cover Design】The rectangular silicone cover of the same color can easily lock the freshness and smell of the butter, and take it out at any time to keep the ingredients dry. Seal it in a refrigerator or freezer to prevent moisture and ensure that no dust or other particles enter when placed. Don't worry about spilling and overflowing when moving. 🍭【Equipped With Butter Dish】In addition to the butter molds, we also provide a lovely white butter storage dish, which puts butter, pudding, cornbread, cake and chocolate that popped out in time, which is more worry-free and practical. Pay attention to quality, ensure details, and provide sincere service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NGFahtGQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WJPILIS","source_asin":"B08DK5861X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DK5861X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DK5861X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
