window.products.push({"id":1139308,"name":"SONGMICS 4-Tier Shoe Rack, Shoe Storage Organizer with Metal Frame, Non-Woven Fabric Layer, for Hallway, Bedroom, Living Room, 17.7 x 11 x 31.5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yh4KIULsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All Under Control: Gone are the days of stuffing limited floor space with a flood of shoes swimming here and there. On this 4-tier shoe rack, you can neatly store your sneakers, flats, and more. Not enough space for high heels? Come, remove one layer! Small Change, Big Effect: \"Oh, no! The rack is already full! Where should I put my slippers?\" Shhh, we'll let you in on a little secret: thanks to the raised feet, there's still plenty of room underneath! So feel free to corral them in! Every Inch Counts: Featuring a compact profile, you can easily set this shoe rack in the hallway, living room, or bedroom. It helps you maximize your vertical space while saving more floor space for other items—good news for small areas! Easy-Peasy Assembly: You don't have to be an expert to set up this 17.7”L x 11”W x 31.5”H storage rack, as we provide you with the necessary expertise in the form of illustrated and detailed instructions Trio of Durability: Robust metal tubes, premium non-woven fabric, and high quality plastic connectors—thanks to the perfect union of these materials, this shoe storage shelf boasts a good load-bearing capacity (up to 6.6 lb per shelf)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yh4KIULsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SONGMICS","source_asin":"B08KGCWGPZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KGCWGPZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KGCWGPZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139309,"name":"Elephant balloons (16 pcs) by Nerdy Words (Grey & Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wJKeIYA+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add some pachyderms to your next event! These cute elephant balloons are perfect for baby showers, birthday parties, safari- or circus-themed events and much more!Balloons are helium quality and come in metallic silver (grey) and light pink. 16 balloons in each pack. BALLOON SPECIFICATIONS: Material: Helium Quality, 100% Biodegradable Latex Material: Helium Quality, 100% Biodegradable Latex Size: 12 Inch (30 cm) Size: 12 Inch (30 cm) Color: Grey & Light Pink Color: Grey & Light Pink Package: 16 Balloons Package: 16 Balloons Design: White Ink, 1-Side Design: White Ink, 1-Side BALLOON INFLATION: If the balloons are properly inflated (ie. not over- or under-inflated) they will last about 8-14 hours if helium filled and 5-7 days if air filled. Actual flying time will vary depending on temperature and atmospheric conditions. **If left outside in the hot sun or rain, the balloons will last only a few hours.** WARNING! CHOKING HAZARD - Children under 8 years can choke or suffocate on uninflated or broken balloons. Adult supervision required. Keep uninflated balloons away from children. Discard broken balloons at once. MISE EN GARDE! DANGER D'ÉTOUFFEMENT - Les enfants de moins de 8 ans peuvent s'étouffer ou suffoquer avec des ballons non gonflés ou éclatés. La surveillance doit être assurée par un adulte. Tenir les ballons non gonflés à l'écart des enfants. Jeter immédiatement les ballons éclatés.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wJKeIYA+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nerdy Words","source_asin":"B0746V4FYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746V4FYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746V4FYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
