window.products.push({"id":1139365,"name":"Luigi Bormioli Styles 6 oz Sparkling Wine Glasses (Set Of 2), Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i57geV9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It’s never been easier to buy the right wine glasses, Thanks to the Wine Style collection. This collection is an innovative concept, the wine stemglasses are classified into 9 color coded wine Styles, which makes it easy and economical to buy high quality wine glasses for the correct wine. Each wine style has a different color code and groups together wines around common aromatic and taste elements. The wine glasses are coming in various sizes and shapes. You can use those stylish glasses at your bar, restaurant or home. No matter how big your party is, those glasses would be an amazing addition to your table and will enhance everyone’s drinking experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i57geV9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luigi Bormioli","source_asin":"B008OYP2A2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008OYP2A2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008OYP2A2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
