window.products.push({"id":1139371,"name":"CLEAN PERCENT Soap Dispenser Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YdTmsxezS._AC_SL1125_.jpg","description":"【Practical Combination】Combine the Soap Pump Dispenser and sponge holder, not only achieving space-saving effect, but also preventing water accumulation on kitchen counter, thus making your kitchen neat and tidy. Besides, crafted with thickened ABS, which is sturdy, durable, safe and BPA-free. 【Easy One-handed Operation】Just need to press with one hand to pump out detergent with ease, quick and convenient to use, which is user friendly even for children and the elders, especially for arthritic. 【Saving Soap】Our Soap Pump Dispenser is able to contain 8.5 fluid ounces detergent. And owing to the special pump design, the dispenser helps you make the most out of the detergent without wasting. It will be an ideal gift for friends and family. 【Innovative Design】Only the top drain tray is detachable, so there's no need to worry about water leakage or loose closure due to frequent opening. The hollow-out drain tray helps the sponge dry quickly, and the water storage tray prevents sewage flowing back into the detergent container. 【Anti-slip Base】This Dish Soap Dispenser is equipped with anti-slip strip on the bottom, making it more secure and stable on the counter without easily sliding. Apart from the Soap Dispenser, the package also includes 1 sponge scouring pad.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YdTmsxezS._AC_SL1125_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CLEAN PERCENT","source_asin":"B08V11WMR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V11WMR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V11WMR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139372,"name":"Cork Genius Air Pressure Wine Opener, Manual Air Pump Wine Bottle Opener, Durable Cork Remover for Wine Bottles, Portable and Easy Wine Needle Opener ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o9PqClezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SKIP THE CORKSCREW AND OPEN ANY BOTTLE IN SECONDS - The Cork Genius air pump wine opener, you'll never need another corkscrew ever again. With a simple push, pump, and pop, you can remove the cork from any wine bottle in just a few seconds. No more turning, pulling, or tugging on corkscrew openers. AIR LIFT TECHNOLOGY FOR EASY OPENING - With a unique wine pump design, the Cork Genius air pressure wine opener uses a one-of-a-kind air lift approach that uses the natural pressure from the bottle to pop the cork out. It’ll be the easiest wine bottle opening experience you’ve ever had. INDESTRUCTIBLE POLYCARBONATE AND STAINLESS-STEEL MATERIALS - With durable and indestructible polycarbonate and stainless-steel materials, the Cork Genius cork opener is perfect for both personal and professional use and will be the last wine bottle opener you'll ever need. NO MORE BROKEN CORK IN YOUR WINE - When it comes to opening wine bottles, no one should have to deal with broken or destroyed corks. With the long needle and convenient need guide, the Cork Genius wine cork opener will ensure that you open your wine bottle right the first time without the hassle of pieces of broken cork falling into your wine. GUIDE FOR EASY PLACEMENT ON BOTTLE - Each opener is made with convenient guides that help you to get a perfect placement on each bottle. Just slip the opener over the top of the bottle and allow the guides to lead the neck of the bottle directly into the needle for a quick and easy opening.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o9PqClezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CORK GENIUS","source_asin":"B08GM9JKBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GM9JKBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GM9JKBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139373,"name":"Cooling Blankets, Bamboo Blanket for All-Season, Cooling Blanket Absorbs Body Heat Soft Blend Blanket for Couch Bed (Gray, One Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712n73MQoHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDE: 1 x Bamboo Blanket (80x 100 cm) PRODUCT FEATURES: Our ultra-soft blanket is made of natural bamboo material, and is safe and chemical-free. Bamboo fabric has unique resilience to keep its shape. Smooth and softer than cotton, it is perfect for sensitive skin. PRODUCT FUNCTION: Our bamboo blanket is cool has good breathability. When used in hot weather, the cooling blanket can keep your cool and dry, and can help your fall asleep faster. Our bamboo blanket is not too thick, but has some weight. EASY CARE: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Cool iron if needed. Tumble dry low. Cool iron if needed. Do not bleach. Perfect gift for the one you love and care. Bamboo is amazingly cool in summer (average 3°F cooler). It is cool against your body and it is comfortable under all temperatures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712n73MQoHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oxodoi","source_asin":"B095WWYMYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WWYMYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WWYMYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139374,"name":"MOSADE 4FT Artificial Bird of Paradise Plant,Tall Fake Tropical Palm Tree with Woven Seagrass Basket, Realistic Faux Tree,8 Detachable Trunks Silk Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g2P8LVT2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lifelike Design & Exquisite Details – Our artificial bird of paradise tree in pot is designed with lush branches and leaves that mimic the real tree thanks to the lifelike details and natural shapes. you can hardly tell it from a real one when looking from short distance. Perfect for indoor decoration. Handmade Natural Seagrass Basket – This fake bird of paradise plant comes in a hand-woven seagrass basket that’s exquisitely made to achieve functionality and beautiful appearance at the same time. The rustic and stylish seagrass basket adds to the natural sense of the faux palm tree. 4Feet Fake Tree for All Rooms – With a height of about 4Feet, this faux potted tropical palm plant is an ideal decoration for almost all rooms, including bedrooms, living rooms, dining rooms, kitchen, bathrooms, and for business spaces such as restaurants, coffee shops and more. Also great for sheltered outdoors such as patio, balcony and porch. Selected material,Built to last,Free detachable – Branch can free detachable,easy to assembly,real touch, that’s not easy to deform and can withstand aging, the leaves are made of artificial silk fabric which is durable and easy to wipe clean, so the tall fake plant can bring elegance and romance to the room for years to come-perfect for those who has no time or experience of taking care of real plants.. When you don't need it, you can accommodate it into the carton and don't take your space. Your Satisfaction Comes First – MOSADE is a company with years of expertise designing, developing, and manufacturing high-quality indoor and outdoor decorative artificial plants. Contact us if you have any questions. We'll be happy to assist you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g2P8LVT2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOSADE","source_asin":"B0B6CJVBJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6CJVBJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6CJVBJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
