window.products.push({"id":1139499,"name":"Orbit Clocks 24 inch Large Wooden Wall Clock, Contemporary Black Roman Numbers, Orange Needles Brown Wood Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tp+TajZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DISTRESSED TEXTURED Rustic Natural Wood Rim SEE THROUGH DESIGN incorporates the color of the wall. Cut through dial with roman numerals 3D EFFECT - Easy to ready from every corner of your home SILENT SWEEPING MOVEMENT: To ensure an undisturbed environment, our non-ticking wall clock features an ultra-silent sweep mechanism providing absolute silence; With no plastic parts, no poly stickers, and no vinyl prints, this wood-made silent wall clock is not only the most decorative large wall clock for living rooms but most comforting to everyone's ears CONTEMPORARY MEDIUM TONE: Orange Gloss finish wood needles as extra sets with the clock. Easy to hang with the keyhole hanger SIZE : 60cm x 60cm x 5.5cm (24 Inches), 2 Feet. It runs on Standard Battery 1-AA type (Battery not included). MATERIAL: Birch Wood, Metal Rivet. Handmade made from solid birch and pine woods CLASSIC FACE DESIGN: Large size wooden wall clock with smooth glossy finish and fabulous wood grains. Premium and luxury product handcrafted with perfection. No harmful dyes or chemicals used. Special packaging. Moisture and damp resistance. Carefully crafted and designed specifically for large living rooms, big size walls. NO HASSLE AFTER-SALES: We are very confident your new battery wall clock for home will be loved, admired, and enjoyed daily; However, if for any reason you are not 100% satisfied with your purchase, please return this analog clock for walls within 30 days for a no questions asked to exchange or full refund while 1-year warranty covers unlike problems","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tp+TajZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orbit Clocks","source_asin":"B09ST4PW57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ST4PW57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ST4PW57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139500,"name":"Cocktail Gift Sets with Cocktail Glasses, Glass Straws, Cocktail Picks, Muddler, Measuring Cup – Food Grade Stainless Steel and Glass – Ideal for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fMTA+7mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrating an important life event, a new achievement or a special milestone provides another opportunity to be together with the people you love. That is why we put together a wide and diverse gift set collection to offer you the right present for every occasion, that will feel your loved ones’ hearts with joy and gratitude while celebrating and sharing unique moments together. Our gift sets are carefully designed to save you time and energy with finding the perfect present, as they are both practical and versatile, as well as modern and beautiful. If you are not 100% pleased with your purchase, we are always at your disposal for any issues or concerns.  Lovely Cocktail Gift Set with Elegant Curved Glasses and Accessories   This glasses set with cocktail accessories perfectly combines functionality with an elegant, modern touch, being ideal for experimenting with your favorite beverages, unleashing your creativity and impressing your guests with gorgeous looking and delicious drinks. Made using the finest quality materials, with optimally sized glasses that fit a wide range of traditional cocktails, plus superb box packaging that holds everything in place, this cocktail set is ready-to-gift for family, friends, colleagues and loved ones!  Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product:  Set includes: 2 x 17.6oz double curved glasses, 2 x 10oz single curve glasses, 4 x glass straws, 4 x cocktail picks, double sided measuring cup, stainless steel muddler, luxurious gift box; Heat resistant eco-friendly borosilicate glass; Cryogenic heat resistant straws; Non-toxic dishwasher safe pick for elegant touch; Ergonomic non-bending muddler for easy handling and perfect results; Designed in the USA; Ideal cocktail gifts for men, women, family, friends, mixology enthusiasts; Great choice for birthdays, anniversaries, housewarming, Christmas, and other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fMTA+7mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evidan","source_asin":"B0B9BNM1N4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BNM1N4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BNM1N4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
