window.products.push({"id":1139523,"name":"Wet Dry Vacuum Cleaner, Cordless Vacuum Cleaner and Mop for Hardwood Floor & Area Rugs, Wet-Dry Floor Cleaner with Separate Clean & Dirty Water Tank, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613f-6+aH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【All-in-One Vacuum and Mop】 - Cordless wet-dry floor cleaner is definitely what you need with your housework. Vacuum and wash at the same time save your time in one easy step. Adding solution to the wet-dry vacuum cleaner, you can control how much formula you want with the water spray button. Keeps the floor clean and streak free .The cordless design of this vacuum mop is perfect for effortless mopping everywhere in the house. 【Self-Cleaning & Separate Water Tank】 - VMAI wet dry floor washer with separate clean and dirty water tanks. Clean water will spray to the floor with your control, and the mess will be collected into the dirty water. No need to mop one place again and again. You can easily take off the dirty water tank and pour out the dirty water. Self-cleaning system of the floor washer keeps your hands clean, brush fresh and your home odor-free. Set your hand free from washing brush and avoid tube suction. 【Voice Assistance】 - VMAI cordless vacuum and mop floor cleaner provides voice assistance and tells you the status of the wet dry floor washer in daily cleaning. The sweet voice assistance will remind you to turn on the self-cleaning function after charging on the station. You won’t forget to refresh the wet dry vacuum mop cleaner anymore. Our smart floor and carpet cleaner will tell you when to empty the dirty water tank, add water and recharge as it needs. 【Multi-Surface Floor Washer】 - You can apply this vacuum and mop cleaner for multi-surface, such as hardwood floor, tile floor, marble floor and etc. With a rug brush in the package, you can also clean the area rug and pick up pet hairs efficiently. Remove the kitchen messy and sticky spills quickly, then remove your housework trouble at the same time! 【Accessories】 - We have 1 x Wet/Dry vacuum and mop cleaner, 1 x Battery, 1 x Roller Brush, 1 x Rug Brush, 1 x Cleaning Tool, 1 x Charging Station, 1 x Power Cord. 1 x User Manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613f-6+aH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VMAI","source_asin":"B08J82T88V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J82T88V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J82T88V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
