window.products.push({"id":1139633,"name":"George Foreman GFG21 21-Inch Griddle, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W2VPSD88L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description George Foreman 21 -inch non stick griddle. Amazon.com As a complement to his series of grills, George Foreman includes this griddle in his line of low-fat cooking tools for the indoor chef. Designed to help direct grease away from food and minimize the need for cooking fat, the griddle is great for grilled sandwiches, eggs and ham, and dinner items like chicken breasts and burgers. At 21 by 11 inches, its cooking surface is more than generous, allowing for multiple menu items to cook at once. The adjustable temperature probe is speedy and efficient, and a nonstick coating helps food release without butter or oil and cleans up easily. Several structural details are useful here, including the raised backstop for food removal and the broad drip channel. Cool-touch handles protect hands and an attachable side tray holds cooked food. With the temperature control removed, the griddle is fully immersible, and the included spatula, service tray, and drip catcher are all safe in the dishwasher. Backed by a one-year warranty, the griddle measures 27 by 15 inches and stands 4 inches high. --Emily Bedard From the Manufacturer George Foreman's 21-inch griddle features a non-stick cooking surface and a drip tray for run-off fats. The backstop makes food removal easy and side handles offer added convenience. This griddle measures 27 by 15 by 4 inches. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W2VPSD88L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"George Foreman","source_asin":"B00022Z466","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00022Z466","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00022Z466","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
