window.products.push({"id":1139683,"name":"Lush Decor Blush Textured Dot Grommet Sheer Window Curtain Panel Pair (84\" x 38\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126YuouV8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to add a touch of elegance to your windows? With so many beautiful options for coverings, windows are one of the most decorated fixtures in the home, and dressing them with curtains is a great way to accent your space with tasteful design, bold colors, or interesting texture. From drapes to curtains and from blinds to shades, it can be difficult to find a window covering that will suit your taste best. Matching your interior decor without overtaking the space doesn't have to be overwhelming! The simplicity and beauty of the Lush Decor sheer curtain panel set makes it a wonderful addition to any home by adding a sophisticated design that’s suitable for any space.Add the final touch to your home decor with this versatile pair of curtain panels. With a sheer texture, they can serve as an added layer to Venetian blinds and heavy drapes. The set goes well with other window coverings and also looks beautiful on its own. Accent the view from your window with our sheer curtains, and give your room some privacy while letting sunlight in to brighten your home. A wonderful transition between indoor and outdoor spaces, these panels feature a simple dot pattern that adds texture to any room. The solid blush color blends seamlessly with any theme or decor, enhancing the ambiance of your space.Hanging a curtain shouldn’t be difficult or time-consuming. Our set comes with metal grommets so you can easily and quickly install the textured panels. Simply thread the rod into the first hole in the panel, and then weave the rest of the grommets onto the rod. Because of their elegant simplicity and versatile design, these curtain panels make a great gift for weddings, anniversaries, and housewarmings. With designs, styles, and colors to match any interior decor, you can count on Lush Decor's collection of sheer and lightweight window curtains to make your windows the focal point of your living space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126YuouV8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B082F1PLZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082F1PLZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082F1PLZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
