window.products.push({"id":1139996,"name":"Maltese Mug, Maltese Gift, Includes Custom Text","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710GcQwpQ-L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mug pictured is a 11 oz right hand mug. Perfect for any Maltese loving person in your life! Great for home or office use, to use for dog treats, pencils, brushes, or whatever! Add a matching ornament for a great gift set. Personalize with a message or name that makes it a thoughtful and special gift for the Maltese lover in your life. Printed from my original painting that was a commissioned pastel. Send a gift note with your order! Just add wording and I will send on my shop stationary.Maltese ornaments and tote bag that can be personalized, also in my Amazon shop!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710GcQwpQ-L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtByJulene","source_asin":"B079DWV25Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079DWV25Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079DWV25Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139997,"name":"Music Box Women Gift, Love You to The Moon and Back, Romantic Gifts to Daughter Son Kids Anniversary Birthday Valentine Wedding Present Play You are M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MCFbcSRsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"CUTE MUSIC BOX GIFT: Our wind up panda music box engraved with romantic quotes \" love you to the moon and back\". GIFT FOR COUPLE LOVER: Our panda music box is romantic gift for wife, girlfriend, boyfriend, husband ,women, lover as birthday gift, anniversary gift, valentine's day gift, Christmas gift, Mother's day gift, father's day gifts etc. SIZE AND MATERIAL: Our music box size is about 2.83*2.3*2inch(7.1x5.8x5cm),it is made of woody, non-toxic and non-irritating odor, and it is bigger than others hand cranked music box. YOU ARE MY SUNSHINE: Our wooden music box brings a well-known tune:\"YOU ARE MY SUNSHINE\" WIND UP MUSIC BOX: Music box is easy to operate,no need battery,just turn the spring tightly then release and it will play.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MCFbcSRsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bowu","source_asin":"B09JBGLHTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JBGLHTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JBGLHTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1139998,"name":"Fashion Bed Group Sycamore Twin Size Bed with Frame in Hammered Copper Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dcxP7n6PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sycamore bed captures the wonder of the fleeting summer season, while providing a whimsical design that will stand out in any master suite or guestroom. Constructed of carbon steel for stability and years of everyday use, the 50-inch headboard and 29.75-inch footboard are coated in a Hammered Copper finish that has a textured effect with a black base and copper metallic highlighting. This bedroom piece has a unique pattern of leaves whirling from an invisible wind that are forever frozen in space. Fence-like final posts stand erect, stopping the leaves from cascading to the ground. The arched grills gently curve up and then back down again. At the center, a spray of leaves rises toward the sky as if in a vase. This gives the bed an aura of formality and hospitality. Widely spaced spindles grace the arms and back of the bed. The design is airy and carefree as an autumn day should be. The engineered bed frame consists of iron rails, cross arms and glides to provide full support to your mattress and box spring. A good ornamental bed, like the Sycamore, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a duo headboard and footboard panel, leg extensions, bed frame, instructions, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Sycamore Complete Bed comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dcxP7n6PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B002HWRCRI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1139998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002HWRCRI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002HWRCRI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
